[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3575224715","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113129#issuecomment-3575224715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113129","id":3575224715,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VGZmL","user":{"login":"TheSofox","id":3089525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODk1MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3089525?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox","html_url":"https://github.com/TheSofox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T11:39:47Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T11:39:47Z","body":"First, let me demonstrate the three options:\r\n\r\n1) Material\r\n<img width=\"706\" height=\"507\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eddb5268-c96b-4dda-9fef-6249b579ab52\" />\r\n\r\n2) Active\r\n<img width=\"652\" height=\"530\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e0c300b-9529-4039-ba6f-a27037d909ef\" />\r\n\r\n3) None\r\n<img width=\"664\" height=\"530\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc0e249c-b8f1-4de2-aca5-b7f6ef1cc5d5\" />\r\n\r\nIn order to switch from `Material`, which is the Default, to `Active`, which is probably the desired result, you'd need to change the setting in the import settings dropdown (screenshot in initial post).\r\n\r\nOf course, this raises the query about what the Default value should be, whether it should have been `Active` whenever you load up.\r\n\r\nHonestly,  I can change the Default value very easily, the reason I chose `MATERIAL` is because that was what Godot chose in the past. \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3575224715/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576614645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113129#issuecomment-3576614645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113129","id":3576614645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VLs71","user":{"login":"TheSofox","id":3089525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODk1MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3089525?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox","html_url":"https://github.com/TheSofox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-25T16:54:21Z","updated_at":"2025-11-25T16:54:21Z","body":"Okay, took some advice from @fire and pushed an update. Current behaviour:\r\nIf the system parses a legacy `blender/meshes/colors=true` it will set the value to `Material` which should preserve existing behaviour with recent Blender releases.\r\nHowever, if they set up a fresh new model, or delete the `.import` file, or otherwise reset import settings, the default value will be `Active`, which would make the model in the original bug report import perfectly first time.\r\nThis should definitely fix the original issue on all fresh projects, while preserving compatibility with existing projects as much as possible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576614645/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3576817988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113129#issuecomment-3576817988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113129","id":3576817988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7VMelE","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_adm