Colors = True` becomes `Meshes -> Vertex Colors = Material`\r\n* .blend files with `Meshes -> Colors = False` becomes `Meshes -> Vertex Colors = None`\r\n* Setting `Meshes -> Vertex Colors = Active` correctly imports the vertex colors\r\n\r\n<img width=\"834\" height=\"562\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-25 at 6 29 26 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2034a97-c91f-456c-8fa1-9c9a115162fa\" />\r\n<img width=\"789\" height=\"534\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-01-25 at 6 30 09 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cedb817-b848-46f1-90d8-7cd48ea2d794\" />\r\n\r\nGenerally everything appears to be working as it should here.  It's unlikely this will get in 4.6, but any chance of 4.6.1?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3797472254/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3800509374","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113129#issuecomment-3800509374","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113129","id":3800509374,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ihyu-","user":{"login":"TheSofox","id":3089525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODk1MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3089525?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox","html_url":"https://github.com/TheSofox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com